      "content": "idk i guess. it just feels like people are just pretending like things are fine so they dont have to face it. like, the math just doesnt add up. we're just rearranging deck chairs on the titanic. what's the point of even trying to find peace in small moments when the big picture is just total collapse? it feels so hollow.",
